window.MG_LAZY_DATA["data/lazy/resources/c364-3dd56abb2fdae176.json"]={sha256:"3dd56abb2fdae176036e0d41fcd67689a2fdf0cc9d21fe297e71c8c74e8dd207",value:{"sources":[{"id":"v24-case-d39649be26535683","url":"https://www.isas.jaxa.jp/en/missions/spacecraft/past/hayabusa.html","title":"JAXA ISAS HAYABUSA","titleEn":"JAXA ISAS HAYABUSA","publisher":"JAXA","scope":"查證具名案例與原理背景。課內數值、故障資料與判準為原創教學假設；請勿當作廠商規格或操作程序。","scopeEn":"Establish named case and principle context. Numbers, fault data, and criteria are original teaching assumptions, not manufacturer specifications or operating procedures."}],"media":{"courses":[{"courseId":"c364","videos":[],"guides":[]}]},"related":{"courses":[{"courseId":"c364","related":[{"id":"c365","referenceUrls":["https://global.jaxa.jp/projects/sas/hayabusa2/"],"title":"Hayabusa2 小行星採樣","titleEn":"Hayabusa2 asteroid sample return","why":"用兩課的可觀察驗收條件比較模型邊界：教學 1σ 容許 3 m，300 s 案例需更新導航；此門檻不作實機接近放行。 每項結論須附輸入、單位、版本與未解限制。","whyEn":"Compare model boundaries using observable acceptance criteria: For a teaching 1σ allowance of 3 m, the 300 s case needs a navigation update; this is not a flight approach clearance. Attach inputs, units, revision and unresolved limitations to each conclusion.","difference":"評估小樣品質量分配對代表性與保留量的影響。","differenceEn":"Evaluate how small-sample allocation affects representativeness and retained material.","transfer":"保留單位與邊界條件，僅轉移可證明相容的驗證方法。","transferEn":"Retain units and boundary conditions; transfer only demonstrably compatible verification methods.","practice":["以下皆為教學假設，非實際任務參數。合成初始位置 1σ=2 m，速度誤差 0.01 m/s，預測 120 s。 先按量綱手算，再以試算表獨立列式。教學名義算例：σ=sqrt(2²+(120×0.01)²)。 結果約 2.33238 m。不相關誤差下位置預測 σ=sqrt(σx²+(tσv)²)；假設短時等速且無交叉協方差。","以下皆為教學假設，非實際任務參數。合成顆粒稀有成分比例 p=0.02，隨機抽取 n=50。 先按量綱手算，再以試算表獨立列式。教學名義算例：P=1−0.98^50。 結果約 0.63583 fraction。獨立隨機抽取 n 顆粒時，至少一顆稀有成分的機率=1−(1−p)^n；團聚或偏選時失效。","比較兩個模型的輸入、誤差與驗收條件，記錄不能沿用的假設。"],"practiceEn":["All values are teaching assumptions, not mission specifications. Synthetic initial position 1σ is 2 m, velocity error 0.01 m/s and prediction horizon 120 s. Calculate by hand with units, then independently formulate a worksheet. Synthetic nominal case: σ=sqrt(2²+(120×0.01)²). Result ≈ 2.33238 m. For uncorrelated errors σ=sqrt(σx²+(tσv)²), assuming short-duration constant velocity and no cross covariance.","All values are teaching assumptions, not mission specifications. Use synthetic rare-grain fraction p=0.02 and n=50 random grains. Calculate by hand with units, then independently formulate a worksheet. Synthetic nominal case: P=1−0.98^50. Result ≈ 0.63583 fraction. For n independent random grains, probability of at least one rare component is 1−(1−p)^n; clustering or selection bias invalidates it.","Compare inputs, errors, and criteria; document assumptions that cannot be transferred."]},{"id":"c374","referenceUrls":["https://www.nasa.gov/the-apollo-program/"],"title":"Apollo 載人月球工程","titleEn":"Apollo crewed lunar engineering","why":"用兩課的可觀察驗收條件比較模型邊界：教學 1σ 容許 3 m，300 s 案例需更新導航；此門檻不作實機接近放行。 每項結論須附輸入、單位、版本與未解限制。","whyEn":"Compare model boundaries using observable acceptance criteria: For a teaching 1σ allowance of 3 m, the 300 s case needs a navigation update; this is not a flight approach clearance. Attach inputs, units, revision and unresolved limitations to each conclusion.","difference":"以火箭方程比較攜帶無用結構質量對速度增量的影響。","differenceEn":"Use the rocket equation to compare the velocity penalty of carrying inactive structural mass.","transfer":"保留單位與邊界條件，僅轉移可證明相容的驗證方法。","transferEn":"Retain units and boundary conditions; transfer only demonstrably compatible verification methods.","practice":["以下皆為教學假設，非實際任務參數。合成初始位置 1σ=2 m，速度誤差 0.01 m/s，預測 120 s。 先按量綱手算，再以試算表獨立列式。教學名義算例：σ=sqrt(2²+(120×0.01)²)。 結果約 2.33238 m。不相關誤差下位置預測 σ=sqrt(σx²+(tσv)²)；假設短時等速且無交叉協方差。","以下皆為教學假設，非實際任務參數。教學有效排氣速度 3000 m/s，燃燒前質量 10000 kg，後 6000 kg。 先按量綱手算，再以試算表獨立列式。教學名義算例：Δv=3000 ln(10000/6000)。 結果約 1532.48 m/s。理想 Δv=ve ln(m0/mf)，只計質量比；實際還有重力、操控與軌道損失。","比較兩個模型的輸入、誤差與驗收條件，記錄不能沿用的假設。"],"practiceEn":["All values are teaching assumptions, not mission specifications. Synthetic initial position 1σ is 2 m, velocity error 0.01 m/s and prediction horizon 120 s. Calculate by hand with units, then independently formulate a worksheet. Synthetic nominal case: σ=sqrt(2²+(120×0.01)²). Result ≈ 2.33238 m. For uncorrelated errors σ=sqrt(σx²+(tσv)²), assuming short-duration constant velocity and no cross covariance.","All values are teaching assumptions, not mission specifications. Use teaching effective exhaust speed 3000 m/s, initial mass 10000 kg and final mass 6000 kg. Calculate by hand with units, then independently formulate a worksheet. Synthetic nominal case: Δv=3000 ln(10000/6000). Result ≈ 1532.48 m/s. Ideal Δv=ve ln(m0/mf) captures mass ratio only; real flight includes gravity, steering and trajectory losses.","Compare inputs, errors, and criteria; document assumptions that cannot be transferred."]}],"references":[{"id":"v24-case-2cb2de30bc21f35d","url":"https://global.jaxa.jp/projects/sas/hayabusa2/","title":"JAXA Hayabusa2","titleEn":"JAXA Hayabusa2","publisher":"JAXA","scope":"查證具名案例與原理背景。課內數值、故障資料與判準為原創教學假設；請勿當作廠商規格或操作程序。","scopeEn":"Establish named case and principle context. Numbers, fault data, and criteria are original teaching assumptions, not manufacturer specifications or operating procedures."},{"id":"v24-case-cd812198c8b53547","url":"https://www.nasa.gov/the-apollo-program/","title":"NASA The Apollo Program","titleEn":"NASA The Apollo Program","publisher":"NASA","scope":"查證具名案例與原理背景。課內數值、故障資料與判準為原創教學假設；請勿當作廠商規格或操作程序。","scopeEn":"Establish named case and principle context. Numbers, fault data, and criteria are original teaching assumptions, not manufacturer specifications or operating procedures."}],"overview":"比較相鄰案例與另一組案例的模型、可量測結果及可轉移的驗證方法。","overviewEn":"Compare neighboring and cross-group cases by model, measurable outcome, and transferable verification method."}]},"places":{"courses":[]},"vendors":{"courses":[],"vendors":[]}}};
